  "short_description": "Build the multi-step LinkedIn sequence for a Dreamstate campaign: connection request, waits, and DMs wired into a validated graph. Use whenever the user wants to 'build a sequence', 'design the cadence', set up campaign steps, or define the follow-up flow. Stage 5 of the pipeline: it constructs and validates the sequence, it does not enroll or send. You design the cadence; Dreamstate stores it as a versioned step graph and checks it before launch.",
